        <mxCell id="legend" value="1 Publish documents. 2 Start the guarded sync. 3 Sync (StartIngestionJob, GetIngestionJob). 4 Run the integrity canary through RetrieveAndGenerate. 5 Record a GOOD or SUSPECT recovery point. 6 GOOD: done. 7 SUSPECT: diff against the last GOOD recovery point and triage with Amazon Bedrock. 8 Roll back harmful documents, then sync and verify again (once). 9 Notify. Dashed lines: reads and writes performed by the services." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#545B64;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="728" width="1150" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
